cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite the paper below."
title: "Agentic vs. Human Benchmark - Replication Package"
abstract: >-
  Analysis harness for the paper "Structural Quality and Security in Agentic
  Software Engineering: A Multi-Dimensional Empirical Evaluation". Runs one
  deterministic pipeline (Radon, complexipy, Bandit, pylint, CPD) plus two
  specification-derived oracle test suites over the study subjects and renders
  the paper's tables as CSV.
type: software
